# Whisper model to load. Default is distil-large-v3 (fast, accurate, ~1.5GB on disk).
# Other popular options:
#   Systran/faster-distil-whisper-large-v3   — default, fastest
#   Systran/faster-whisper-large-v3          — bigger, more accurate
#   Systran/faster-whisper-medium.en         — English-only, very small
#   Systran/faster-whisper-small.en          — tiny, English-only
WHISPER_MODEL=Systran/faster-distil-whisper-large-v3
